Package: Rcoding
Type: Package
Title: Example Datasets and Exercises for R Coding Support
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Bob", "Verity",
      email = "r.verity@imperial.ac.uk",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: This package provides synthetic datasets and supporting materials
    for the R Coding Support module in the School of Public Health, Imperial
    College London. All datasets describe a single simulated scenario -- endemic
    malaria in the fictional Republic of Amani -- so that students meet the same
    people, places and pathogen across the weekly problem sets. Objects range from
    a case line-list and weekly surveillance series to genetic, spatial and
    analysis-output examples. The export_examples() helper writes file copies of
    these datasets for data-import practice.
